<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-W 96 NET DOUBLES TO PLN 4.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-W 96 NET DOUBLES TO PLN 4.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.60 vs   0.57</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.21 vs   0.97</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.58 vs   0.60 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   29.66 vs  15.04</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.38 vs   2.71</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.04 vs   4.50</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.61 vs   2.57</p>
<p> Sales		  114.42 vs  90.92</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Mostostal Warszawa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
